QuakeSpasm's record of a map load, read by qvm/test/ed_load_test.c.

On QuakeSpasm f5fe178: apply, build Quake/, and from Quake/ run

  QEDDUMP=e1m3.dump ./quakespasm -dedicated 1 -basedir DIR +skill 0 +map e1m3 +wait +quit

DIR holds id1/pak0.pak. Run it as ./quakespasm: a long argv[0] fills
CMDLINE_LENGTH and drops +map. PF_setmodel is WinQuake's here, alias
models sized -16..16, and it stores the caller's model string, not
the precache copy.

