index 655fcbc..12f756f 100644
--- a/Quake/pr_edict.c
+++ b/Quake/pr_edict.c
@@ -991,6 +991,258 @@ Used for both fresh maps and savegame loads.  A fresh map would also need
 to call ED_CallSpawnFunctions () to let the objects initialize themselves.
